diagnostics/self-type.em:46:13: `add` takes `Self`, which a value seen as `Addable` cannot supply
      print(a.add(b))
              ^^^
Every type that adopts `Addable` takes a value of its own type here, and this value could be any of them. Call `add` on a value whose type is known.
